{"id":"560573e5a86ebf34","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-analytic-separation.md","title":"Analytic Separation","display":"thm-analytic-separation — Analytic Separation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-analytic-separation","aliases":["58-thm-analytic-separation"],"display":"thm-analytic-separation — Analytic Separation","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-analytic-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-analytic-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytic-separation — Analytic Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (usual topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> (analytic sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\)</span> (analytic-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(B)\\land\nA\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\nA\\subseteq C\\land\nC\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(B)\\land\nA\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\nA\\subseteq C\\land\nC\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The separator contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and is disjoint from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>; equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\setminus B\">\\(A\\subseteq C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\setminus B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Analyticity alone does not imply that either input set is Borel.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ (analytic sets, see [[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)$ (analytic-set predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(B)\\land\nA\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}(C,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\nA\\subseteq C\\land\nC\\cap B=\\varnothing\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq C\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\setminus B","display":false}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c35541773cd6d95","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Lusin separation for disjoint analytic sets is already formalized in [[../batch13/58-thm-analytic-separation.md]] and is not duplicated here."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4027","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-analytic-separation.md|58-thm-analytic-separation]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["eee1caaab6856e0d","9375de7089953a2b"]}